; font-size: 10.5pt;">AI</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">智能体和批判性</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">思维双</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">驱动的大学英语教学改革与实践</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">外国语学院</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">二等奖</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 1pt; text-align: center;"><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">39</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">服务国际传播力提升的融合型外语人才培养模式探索与实践</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">外国语学院</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">二等奖</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 1pt; text-align: center;"><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">40</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">量子芯才：</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">思政引领</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">的集成电路人才培养创新研究</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">集成电路学部</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">二等奖</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 1pt; text-align: center;"><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">41</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">面向</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">课赛融合</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">的全链条产学研协同育人模式创新与实践</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">空间科学与技术学院</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">二等奖</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 1pt; text-align: center;"><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">42</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">突破传统、激发兴趣：</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">AI</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">赋能下以比赛为核心的高校篮球</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">PBL</span><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">教学模式探索与实践</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">体育部</span></p></td><td width="150" style="border-width: 0.5pt; border-style: solid; border-color: black; vertical-align: middle;"><p class="docx_a5" style="text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="min-height: 10.5pt; font-size: 10.5pt;">二等奖</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent: 31.6pt;"><br></p></article><footer><p class="docx_af4" style="text-indent: 28pt; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">— </span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 14pt; font-size: 14pt;"> —</span></p></footer></section>
